title: We go into resistance
subtitle: The Nazis took power and we have an obligation to fight against them
new-page: true
view-if: resistance_enabled = 1 and wels_seen = 1
max-visits: 1

Hitler took power and we have to build a resistance against him.

- @unite_against_fascism: Unite with the KPD against the fascist dictatorship!
- @stay_alone: Only build a resistance with the Weimar Parties.

@unite_against_fascism
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 30: The communists think we are too social fascist to be a good partner against the Nazis. ?]
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 30 
on-arrival: antifa = 1; resistance = 1

We found the Antifascist Action (Antifaschistische Aktion (Antifa)) with the KPD to fight against Hitler.

@stay_alone 
on-arrival: resistance = 1

We don't want to cooperate with the radical communists from the KPD. [? if kpd_relation < 30: The communist don't want to cooperate with us either. ?]